    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n44284" root="&#xA;                        هرل&#xA;                    " body-key="h1">
                        
                            Q. Q. 1
                            <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هَرْوَلَ</span></b> 
                        
                        <i>He walked quickly:</i> (Msb:) [<i>he
went a kind of trotting pace between a walk and
a run;</i> see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رَمَلَ</span>;) <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هَرْوَلَةٌ</span> is <i>not so quick as</i>
                        <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خَبَبٌ</span>
[<i>an amble</i>]; (Msb;) and is <i>between</i>
                        <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَشْىٌ</span> [<i>a walk</i>]
<i>and</i>
                        <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَدْوٌ</span> [<i>a run</i>]: (S, Msb, K:) it is <i>a kind
of</i>
                        <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَدْوٌ</span>: (S:) or <i>quicker than</i>
                        <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَنَقٌ</span>: or <i>a quick
walk.</i> (K.)

